		{
			"name": "CV Management",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "Get All User CVs",
					"request": {
						"auth": {
							"type": "bearer",
							"bearer": [
								{
									"key": "token",
									"value": "{{token}}",
									"type": "string"
								}
							]
						},
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Content-Type",
								"value": "application/json"
							}
						],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/cv",
							"host": [
								"{{base_url}}"
							],
							"path": [
								"cv"
							]
						},
						"description": "Get all CVs owned by the authenticated user.\n\n**Relasi**: User ke CV adalah One-to-Many (1 User bisa punya banyak CV).\n\n**Headers**:\n- Authorization: Bearer {{token}}\n- Content-Type: application/json\n\n**Body**: Tidak ada (GET request)\n\n**Response**:\n```json\n{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"data\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"uuid\",\n      \"fileUrl\": \"/uploads/cv-xxx.pdf\",\n      \"inputType\": \"pdf\",\n      \"status\": \"pending\",\n      \"fileSize\": 128512,\n      \"fileSizeFormatted\": \"125.5 KB\",\n      \"fileExists\": true,\n      \"isParsed\": false,\n      \"parseStatus\": \"pending\",\n      \"createdAt\": \"2026-05-22T...\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"uuid\",\n      \"status\": \"done\",\n      \"isParsed\": true,\n      \"parseStatus\": \"done\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n**Status Values**:\n- `pending`: CV belum diproses\n- `processing`: CV sedang diproses\n- `done`: CV sudah selesai diproses\n\n**Parse Flags**:\n- `isParsed`: Boolean - true jika status = \"done\"\n- `parseStatus`: String - status asli dari database"
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Get Guest CVs (Unlinked)",
					"request": {
						"auth": {
							"type": "bearer",
							"bearer": [
								{
									"key": "token",
									"value": "{{token}}",
									"type": "string"
								}
							]
						},
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Content-Type",
								"value": "application/json"
							}
						],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/cv/guest-cvs",
							"host": [
								"{{base_url}}"
							],
							"path": [
								"cv",
								"guest-cvs"
							]
						},
						"description": "Get unlinked CVs uploaded from the same IP before login.\n\n**Endpoint**: GET /api/cv/guest-cvs\n\n**Headers**:\n- Authorization: Bearer {{token}}\n- Content-Type: application/json\n\n**Response**:\n```json\n{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"data\": {\n    \"count\": 2,\n    \"cvs\": [\n      { \"id\": \"uuid\", \"fileUrl\": \"/uploads/...\", \"status\": \"pending\", \"createdAt\": \"...\" }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**Use Case**: Setelah user login, cek apakah ada CV yang diupload saat masih guest (sebelum login)."
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Link Guest CV to User",
					"request": {
						"auth": {
							"type": "bearer",
							"bearer": [
								{
									"key": "token",
									"value": "{{token}}",
									"type": "string"
								}
							]
						},
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Content-Type",
								"value": "application/json"
							}
						],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/cv/:cvId/link",
							"host": [
								"{{base_url}}"
							],
							"path": [
								"cv",
								":cvId",
								"link"
							],
							"variable": [
								{
									"key": "cvId",
									"value": ""
								}
							]
						},
						"description": "Manually link a guest CV to the authenticated user.\n\n**Endpoint**: POST /api/cv/:cvId/link\n\n**Headers**:\n- Authorization: Bearer {{token}}\n- Content-Type: application/json\n\n**Response**:\n```json\n{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"message\": \"CV successfully linked to user\",\n  \"data\": {\n    \"cvId\": \"uuid\",\n    \"fileUrl\": \"/uploads/...\",\n    \"status\": \"pending\",\n    \"linkedAt\": \"2026-05-22T...\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**Use Case**: User yang sudah login bisa secara manual mengclaim CV yang diupload saat masih guest."
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Get User CV",
					"event": [
