						"description": "Get detailed CV analysis result.\n\n**Endpoint**: GET /api/cv/:cvId/detailed-analysis\n\n**Headers**:\n- Authorization: Bearer {{token}}\n\n**Response**:\n```json\n{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"data\": {\n    \"cvId\": \"uuid\",\n    \"fileUrl\": \"/uploads/...\",\n    \"fileSize\": 125500,\n    \"fileSizeFormatted\": \"122.56 KB\",\n    \"inputType\": \"pdf\",\n    \"status\": \"done\",\n    \"uploadedAt\": \"2026-05-22T...\",\n    \"recommendations\": [\n      { \"rank\": 1, \"title\": \"Software Engineer\", \"score\": 0.9214, \"category\": \"IT\" },\n      { \"rank\": 2, \"title\": \"Backend Developer\", \"score\": 0.8971, \"category\": \"IT\" }\n    ],\n    \"domains\": [\n      { \"domain\": \"Technology\", \"confidence\": 62.3, \"sector\": \"IT & Software\" },\n      { \"domain\": \"Engineering\", \"confidence\": 25.1, \"sector\": \"Engineering\" }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```"
					},
					"response": []
